  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></msqrt></msqrt></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math> are integers, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></msqrt></msqrt></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>,&nbsp;</p><p>Taking L.H.S we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></msqrt></msqrt></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Now put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></math></p><p>So, the integral will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>u</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>4</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></msqrt></msqrt></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now on comparing we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}